    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin provides a Gutenberg block for embedding alugha videos. Simply paste a video URL, video ID, or watchlist URL and the video will be embedded with responsive sizing.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n* Embed videos via URL or ID<br />\n* Watchlist support<br />\n* Responsive 16:9 aspect ratio<br />\n* No build tools required</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate through &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu</li>\n<li>Use the &#8220;alugha Video&#8221; block in the editor</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Embed alugha videos and watchlists via a simple Gutenberg block.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin provides a Gutenberg block for embedding alugha videos. Simply paste a video URL, video ID, or watchlist URL and the video will be embedded with responsive sizing.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n* Embed videos via URL or ID<br />\n* Watchlist support<br />\n* Responsive 16:9 aspect ratio<br />\n* No build tools required</p>\n",
